# Independent tab pages

Each bottom-nav page is a dedicated pair. Change only that pair when asked to update one page:

- Accueil: `scenes/tabs/home_tab.tscn` + `scripts/ui/home_tab.gd`
- Classement: `scenes/tabs/leaderboard_tab.tscn` + `scripts/ui/leaderboard_tab.gd`
- Quiz: `scenes/tabs/quiz_tab.tscn` + `scripts/ui/quiz_tab.gd`
- Social: `scenes/tabs/social_tab.tscn` + `scripts/ui/social_tab.gd`
- Profil: `scenes/tabs/profile_tab.tscn` + `scripts/ui/profile_tab.gd`

Do not share one placeholder scene across tabs. Do not put page-specific UI in `app_shell.tscn`.

`app_shell.tscn` only hosts chrome (top app bar, settings, bottom nav) and instances the five tab scenes in swipe order. Page order lives in `ScenePaths.TAB_PAGE_ORDER` / `TAB_SCENES`.

Optional hook on each tab: `on_tab_shown()` — called when that page becomes visible.
